		  <style></style><div style="opacity:0" class="sc-iJKOTD itWmqZ __pf __pf_zoN138vU" id="__pf"><div data-pf-type="Body" class="sc-bilyIR cCHonK pf-1_"><div data-pf-type="Layout" class="sc-ilfuhL bpQaoh pf-2_"><div data-section-id="pf-1a2f" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-jHkVzv kFoSDU pf-3_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-dVNjXY gaVfQc"><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-4_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-5_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-iUKqMP iPshnk pf-6_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-8_">How to Submit Your Artwork</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-iUKqMP iPshnk pf-9_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-11_">On Website</span></h3><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-12_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-14_">Many of our awards can be customized with your logo or design. If you see “Use Custom Design” listed as an option on the product page for the product you have selected, you may submit your artwork using an upload tool we provide which allows you to upload artwork from your desktop.</span></p><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jObWnj dWwBay pf-15_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/uploadart-1660646729057.jpg?v=1660646730" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/uploadart-1660646729057.jpg?v=1660646730 1536w" width="617" height="188"/></div><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-16_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-18_">Within the product you are ordering:</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fXEqDS fVXmAe pf-19_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-20_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-22_">Select "Custom Design" radio button</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-23_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-25_">Select "Choose Artwork" radio button</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-26_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-28_">Click on the "Upload Your File" button</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-29_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-31_">Select a file from your computer and click "OK".</span></li></ul><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-32_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-34_">Your artwork will be attached to the product you are ordering and will automatically be sent to us with your completed order. This is the preferred way to submit your artwork.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-35_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-36_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-iUKqMP iPshnk pf-37_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-39_">By Email</span></h3><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-40_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-42_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">If you choose to email your artwork separately after your web order has been processed or have placed a phone order:</span></span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fXEqDS fVXmAe pf-43_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-44_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-46_"><span style="font-weight: bold; color: rgb(230, 0, 0);">Please wait to email your artwork until your order is placed to ensure we match up your artwork to the proper order.</span></span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-47_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-49_">Please read Artwork Requirements (below) for file preparation tips, techniques, and requirements for the best reproduction of your logo or design. We prefer 300dpi PDF, EPS, or AI files. We also accept JPEG or TIFF files.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-50_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-52_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Submit your artwork attached to an email to:</span> <a href="mailto:info@hodgesbadge.com" style="color: rgb(0, 71, 178);">info@hodgesbadge.com</a>. To help us help you, please include the following information with your email and attached artwork:</span></li></ul><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fXEqDS fVXmAe pf-53_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-54_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-56_">Name</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-57_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-59_">Organization</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-60_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-62_">Zip code</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-63_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-65_">Daytime Phone Number</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-66_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-68_">Customer Service Representative (if known)</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-69_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-71_">Order Number (from order confirmation, if ordering from web site)</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-72_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-74_">How was your order placed? (phone, email, web site, fax)</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-75_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-77_">Product(s) on which artwork will be used</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-78_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-79_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bqiRlB dabUTs pf-80_"></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-83_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-84_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-iUKqMP iPshnk pf-85_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-87_">Artwork Requirements&nbsp;</span></h3><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-88_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-90_">We prefer 300dpi PDF, EPS, or AI files. We also accept JPEG or TIFF files. Charges may apply if artwork needs to be created or re-touched. All modified artwork may need approval before we begin production on your order. Please respond to the approval request within 24 hours of receiving the modified art. This will avoid any delay, additional shipping charges and/or premium processing fees.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>For more information on artwork requirements please <font color="#0047b2"><a href="/pages/artwork-requirements" target="_self">click here</a></font>.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-91_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-92_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-bqiRlB dabUTs pf-93_"></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-96_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-97_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-iUKqMP iPshnk pf-98_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-100_">Submitting Black and White Designs&nbsp;</span></h3><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-101_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-103_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Please use these guidelines when preparing artwork for the following products:&nbsp;</span></span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fXEqDS fVXmAe pf-104_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-105_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-107_">Hot stamped ribbons, rosettes and sashes&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-108_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-110_">Gold rim and satin finish rosette centers&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-111_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-113_">Rider numbers&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-114_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-116_">Black designs on printed medal centers&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-117_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-119_">Engraved products&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-120_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-122_">Custom medals and coins&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-123_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-125_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">When submitting black and white artwork:&nbsp;</span></span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fXEqDS fVXmAe pf-126_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-127_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-129_">Black and white artwork should have clean, sharp, crisp and solid black lines on a white background.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-130_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-132_">There should not be any shadows, gray, colored or shaded areas.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-133_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-135_">Type must be clean and sharp.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-136_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-138_">Artwork that has less detail will print better.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-139_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-141_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">We accept the following file types:&nbsp;</span></span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fXEqDS fVXmAe pf-142_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-143_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-145_">AI or EPS (Illustrator vector file)&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-146_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-148_">PDF (Illustrator vector or Photoshop file)&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-149_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-151_">TIF (300 dpi)&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-152_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-154_">JPG (High Quality)&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-155_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-157_"><span style="font-weight: bold;">When sending vector files all fonts must be converted to paths.&nbsp;</span></span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fXEqDS fVXmAe pf-158_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-159_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-161_">Designs that are too blurry will need to be recreated.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-162_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-164_">Shadows and shadings will have to be removed.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-165_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-167_">Multicolor designs will have to be recreated in black and white&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-FNXRL brLfuZ pf-168_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-170_">Designs should be clean, sharp and solid.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><div class="sc-llYSUQ bhKSKZ pf-171_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-172_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jObWnj dWwBay pf-173_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/design-blur-1660571392589.jpg?v=1660571398" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/design-blur-1660571392589.jpg?v=1660571398 1536w" width="900" height="900"/></div><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-174_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-176_">Blurry</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-eGPXGI dIjtdz pf-177_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jObWnj dWwBay pf-178_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/design-shadows-1660571392603.jpg?v=1660571407" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0602/3148/3555/t/4/assets/design-shadows-1660571392603.jpg?v=1660571407 1536w" width="900" height="900"/></div><p class="sc-eFegNN jgBUGG pf-179_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmciRz hKEAti pf-181_">Shadows &amp; shading</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-